{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "nodeID": "109",
   "text": "Why did China's tariffs devastate some U.S. exports but have limited effects on others?",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "question",
   "toulmin": "framing",
   "oper": "framing",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#Q"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "110",
   "text": "Substitution and market structure determine the aggregate impact",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "stated_assumption",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.prior",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#P1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "111",
   "text": "Lost sales to China may be redirected elsewhere",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "stated_assumption",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.prior",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#P2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "112",
   "text": "China cannot easily stop buying essential imports",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "stated_assumption",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.prior",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#P3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "113",
   "text": "Much larger decline than manufacturing exports",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#D1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "114",
   "text": "Farmers could not replace lost Chinese demand elsewhere",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#D2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "115",
   "text": "But total U.S. oil exports were largely unaffected",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#D3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "116",
   "text": "Exports fell, then rebounded when China suspended it",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#D4"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "117",
   "text": "Aggregate exports show little obvious tariff break",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#D5"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "118",
   "text": "Aircraft and export-related inputs are poor retaliation targets",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#D6"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "119",
   "text": "Lost Chinese demand becomes lost total exports",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#M1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "120",
   "text": "Sales shift markets without reducing total exports",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#M2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "121",
   "text": "Chinese firms continue buying needed U.S. goods",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#M3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "122",
   "text": "Domestic sales or localization cushion production",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#M4"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "123",
   "text": "Bilateral losses became aggregate export losses",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#C1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "124",
   "text": "Bilateral trade fell without much aggregate effect",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#C2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "125",
   "text": "China had limited leverage in several key sectors",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#C3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "126",
   "text": "Sector structure changes the transmission",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#C4"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "127",
   "text": "The economic effect of tariffs depends heavily on substitution possibilities and sector structure",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "main_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.final",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#K"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "128",
   "text": "China had not tariffed all major U.S. manufacturing exports",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "caveat",
   "toulmin": "qualifier",
   "oper": "qualifier",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#QF1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "129",
   "text": "China may have preserved targets for future retaliation",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "caveat",
   "toulmin": "qualifier",
   "oper": "qualifier",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#QF2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "130",
   "text": "SUV demand and production localization also affected output",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "counterpoint",
   "toulmin": "rebuttal",
   "oper": "rebuttal",
   "localID": "setser_jun_14_19#R1"
  },
